---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout
  path="/about"
  title="About"
  description="Mithahara is a parent brand behind Ahar's vegetarian food in Panchkula, the upcoming Man'sahara venture, and a set of Odoo apps and Chrome extensions."
>
  <section class="page-section">
    <div class="container">
      <h2 class="section-title">About Mithahara</h2>
      <p>
        Mithahara is building sustainable ways to hit your daily dietary goals — through food
        ventures and the software that supports them. It started as a single food venture and has
        grown into a small parent brand with three active threads.
      </p>
      <h3>Ahar</h3>
      <p>
        Ahar is Mithahara's vegetarian food venture, opened 11th January 2025 in Sector 14,
        Panchkula. Fresh idlis, appams, uttapams, and paranthas, served daily from 7 AM to 2:30 PM,
        plated on eco-friendly ware rather than single-use plastic. Ahar also takes bulk orders for
        offices, events, and gatherings.
      </p>
      <h3>Man'sahara</h3>
      <p>
        Man'sahara is Mithahara's upcoming non-vegetarian venture, built on the same premise as
        Ahar — sustainable, healthy, hygienic daily nutrition — for people who eat meat. It's in
        the works.
      </p>
      <h3>Apps</h3>
      <p>
        Alongside the food ventures, Mithahara ships Chrome extensions and Odoo apps: BYOK
        Gateway, Community Cash Reconciler, and Multi-Currency Rounding for Odoo, and ClipMark for
        Chrome. See the <a href="/#apps">Apps section</a> for what's live.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
